      "title": "Area & perimeter",
      "instruction": "Change the side lengths. Watch area and perimeter respond.",
      "explanation": "Side lengths describe a rectangle in metres and range from 0.1 to 100. Area is width times height in square metres; perimeter is twice their sum in metres. The drawing preserves the side-length proportion while adapting its scale to fit."
